<title>UK: Bankers Trust sets warrants on European bonds.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets warrants on European bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>BT Effecten GmbH has issued a total of 500,000 Quattro warrants, in four equal tranches, on four different European bonds including the Bund 6.25 pct April 2006, the OAT 7.25 pct April 2006, the Bono 10.15 pct Jan 2006 and the BTP 8.75 pct July 2006, lead manager Bankers Trust International said.</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   30.APR.97		 PAYDATE	16.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   BER FFT DDF HAM STG   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> WARRANTS	  SPOT REF	  RANGE</p>
<p> BUND		101.30	     97.80 - 102.55</p>
<p> OAT		 108.56	    105.00 - 109.75</p>
<p> BONO		114.25	    110.25 - 116.25</p>
<p> BTP		 101.44	     97.68 - 103.68</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE  BTET</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
